## Features
- Pair of trees with golden pots;
- Realistic PE tips and PVC foliage;
- LEDs with 11 dynamic lighting modes;
- 5m remote control for easy use;
- Cordless design for flexible placement;

## Information
Enhance your entryway or living space with this set of 2 pre-lit Aspen Fir artificial Christmas trees anchored in decorative pot bases. Featuring realistic molded PE outer foliage and dense PVC inner tips, each tree offers 11 dual-colour lighting modes via remote control—allowing adjustments without getting up. Battery powered and flame-retardant tips, they bring safe, symmetrical charm for young and fluffy friends.
